cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Kairos API Quickstart
message: >-
  Getting started with API trading on Kairos. Facts in this repository are derived from
  the Kairos OpenAPI specifications published at https://app.kairos.trade/openapi/ and
  are re-verified against them by scheduled CI.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Kairos
    website: "https://kairos.trade"
repository-code: "https://github.com/kairoslive/kairos-api-quickstart"
url: "https://docs.kairos.trade"
abstract: >-
  A minimal, verified walkthrough of the Kairos prediction-market API: authenticate with
  an API key, find a market on the anonymous market-data tier, place a limit order, poll
  it to a terminal state, and cancel it. Includes runnable Python and TypeScript examples
  and a machine-readable API contract for AI coding assistants.
keywords:
  - prediction markets
  - trading api
  - polymarket
  - kalshi
  - order execution
license: MIT
